TITLE Mix 50 mM DIC with 50 mM Ca (1:1) and heat 20 to 200 C, allow calcite equil

SOLUTION 1 DIC
    temp 20
    pH   7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 50

SOLUTION 2 Ca
    temp 20
    pH   7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca   50

MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.tsv
    -reset false
    -pH true
    -temperature true

END
